      "releaseNotes": "CONTROLLER\n\n* It is now possible to place additional modules next to Controller module on its row. All modules placed on that row will be present on screen in Controller mode.\n\n* Improved color selection for Controller label background/foreground colors.\n\n* Rack position and zoom is now correctly saved and restored when entering and exiting Controller mode.\n\nAPP FEATURES\n\n* Imroved handling of external assets, e.g. samples loaded to sampler modules. We fixed a couple of bugs in this area and made it easier to share patches that use external assets. Please read the updated External Assets section in the app manual for details.",
      "sellerName": "MIFKI PTY LTD",
